    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The gutenberg block for CT Commerce lite to display feature products or related product in page.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>This section describes how to install the plugin and get it working.</p>\n<p>e.g.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/ctcl-product-display</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"where%20do%20i%20use%20this%20block%3F\">\nWhere do I use this block?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>This block can be used to display featured product in home page or related product in product page.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"what%20is%20best%20use%20case%3F\">\nWhat is best use case?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Use column block from built in blocks and add this block to each column.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
